<title>UK: LW Rentenbank adds 50 mln marks to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank adds 50 mln marks to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 200 million marks from 150 million marks lead manager Morgan Stanley said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT  **200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *10.0	MATURITY    18.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REVERSE FRN   ISS PRICE  102.5     PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    100.875   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 LISTING    FFURT     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY FOR 100 MLN MARKS ON 23.MAY.97</p>
<p>		PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>	     *FOR FIRST TWO YEARS THEN 16 PCT MINUS 2 X 6-MONTH</p>
<p>		 LIBOR (BOND EQIV)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
